      "kind": "core-rule",
      "id": "lone-operative"
    },
    "summary": "How **[Lone Operative](vsdata:core-ability/lone-operative)** works in units:\n\n- An **attached unit** benefits from it if all its models have it.\n- If its models have it at different ranges, the whole unit uses the highest among its models on the battlefield.\n- An attached unit **below starting strength** whose remaining models all have it regains it.",
